        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla anyanyae atatũ ma Yovu meewie ũthũku ũsu w’onthe ũla wamũkĩe, mooka kĩla ũmwe kuma vandũ vake; Elivasi Mũtemani, na Mbilitati Mũsui, na Nzovali Mũnaamathi; na matw’a kyathĩ vamwe maende kũmũĩĩa na kũmũkiakisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
