        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla mookĩlilye metho moo me kũasa, na matyaamũmanya, mookĩlya mawasya moo, na kũĩa; na kĩla ũmwe atembũanga ngũa yake ndasa, na molũlĩlya kĩtoo mĩtwenĩ yoo kwelekela ĩtunĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
